      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They also need to stop calibration from happening mid-air. This combination of issues would be a good opportunity to add a button in the bottom right of the quick menu 'Re-calibrate FBT' so that we can manually initiate calibration when needed. Thus these existing issue are less likely to happen due to the forced automated system or we can quickly fix them ourselves and we would finally get the ability to quickly recalibrate.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
